msgctxt "80"
msgid ""
"As a professional, Kiryu-san, what are your thoughts on\r\n"
"the youth of today?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"Well, things were definitely different when I was a kid.\r\n"
"But with how drastically the world has changed, I guess\r\n"
"that's not too much of a surprise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"I'd say the real problem is that we spoon-feed everything\r\n"
"to kids nowadays. There's no room for imagination anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Back in my day, we'd come up with games we could all play\r\n"
"together when we were bored."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"And since we had lots of kids of different ages, we had to\r\n"
"make rules that were fair to everyone. We didn't want to\r\n"
"exclude anyone just because of their age or ability."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"It was through those playground games that we first learned\r\n"
"about cooperation, and what it means to help others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"These days, though... It's all about video games and the\r\n"
"internet. From what I hear most kids would rather stay\r\n"
"in their rooms than go outside to play."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"True, we didn't have any of those luxuries when we were\r\n"
"young. Children nowadays certainly have it good... but in\r\n"
"a way, I feel sorry for them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"Bullying seems to have grown more prevalent as well.\r\n"
"I will admit, it's always been present... but incidents\r\n"
"appear to be even more malicious recently."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"Perhaps the children of today lack basic consideration\r\n"
"for their fellow students..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Looks like it, yeah."
msgstr "Pare di sì, eh."

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, I have another question about your children,\r\n"
"if you don't mind. How do they spend their free time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Well we don't have a computer or any games, so for the most\r\n"
"part they all play together outside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"All the older kids really look after the younger ones, too.\r\n"
"It's like we're one big family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"That sounds lovely. Would it be all right if I paid you\r\n"
"a visit sometime?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Of course, I'd be glad to have you."
msgstr ""

